OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after punch bag 'pushed
OL,4,Aover and landed on him'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after being seriously
OL,7,Finjured when a punch bag machine was
OL,8,Freportedly pushed over and landed on
OL,9,Fhim during an altercation, police have
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FPolice were called to Berkley Street,
OL,13,FToxteth, just before 19:00 GMT on
OL,14,FThursday following reports of a
OL,15,Fdisturbance, Merseyside Police said.
OL,17,FThe victim, in his 50s, suffered a
OL,18,Fserious head injury and was taken to
OL,19,Fhospital, the force added.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
