OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after punch bag 'pushed
OL,4,Aover and landed on him'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIliasse Alhag, 22, of Percy Street,
OL,7,FToxteth, whom police said was a
OL,8,FMoroccan national, has been charged
OL,9,Fwith affray, assault and wounding
OL,10,Fwithout intent and was due to appear at
OL,11,FLiverpool Adult Remand Court earlier.
OL,12,FThe Crown Prosecution Service was
OL,13,Freviewing the charges in light of the
OL,14,Fdeath.
